  "title": "Sweet and Spicy Pumpkin Seeds",
  "description": "Butter, salt, Worcestershire sauce, brown sugar, and hot sauce are all you need to spice up your pumpkin seed haul from Halloween decorating or any fall cooking involving pumpkins.",
